# Repo-root env is NOT the catalog.
#
# Copy apps/dashboard/.env.example → apps/dashboard/.env.local for dashboard
# secrets, or → this directory as `.env` for Docker Compose only.
#
# Optional: put operator tokens used by root scripts here in `.env.local`
# (CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN, POLAR_ACCESS_TOKEN). Never put CHM_* or Polar
# product ids here — those live in apps/dashboard/.env.production.
